  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Step into refined coastal living with this brand-new home at 2A Rangitoto Terrace, Milford, offering a perfect blend of modern design, quality finishes, and a highly sought-after location. Positioned just moments from Milford Beach and village, this home delivers both lifestyle and convenience for families and professionals alike.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Brand new, architecturally designed home\r\n• 195m² floor area on 161m² freehold land\r\n• 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms\r\n• Generous open-plan living and dining\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Internal access garage\r\n• Light-filled interiors with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Zoned for Westlake Boys’ & Westlake Girls’ High Schools and Milford Primary School\r\n• Walking distance to Milford Beach, shops, and cafes\r\n\r\nDesigned for easy living, this home offers a spacious multi-level layout ideal for both everyday comfort and entertaining. Enjoy the vibrant Milford lifestyle with everything you need just minutes away, plus convenient motorway access for commuting. Contact Annie Xu today to arrange a viewing.",
